{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"value"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLGroupSymbolValue","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLGroupSymbolValue","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL19MXLGroupSymbolValueO"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The value of this element."}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"value"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLGroupSymbolValue","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL19MXLGroupSymbolValueO"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLPartSymbolV5valueAA08MXLGroupD5ValueOvp","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"value","symbolKind":"property"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartsymbol\/value"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartSymbol\/value","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartSymbol"]]},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","title":"IvorMXL","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLGroupSymbolValue":{"title":"MXLGroupSymbolValue","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLGroupSymbolValue","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The group-symbol-value type indicates how the symbol for a group or multi-staff part is indicated in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"score."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLGroupSymbolValue","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLGroupSymbolValue","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlgroupsymbolvalue"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPartSymbol":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartsymbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartSymbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLPartSymbol","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The part-symbol type indicates how a symbol for a multi-staff part is indicated in the score; brace is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default value. The top-staff and bottom-staff attributes are used when the brace does not extend across the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entire part. For example, in a 3-staff organ part, the top-staff will typically be 1 for the right hand, while"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the bottom-staff will typically be 2 for the left hand. Staff 3 for the pedals is usually outside the brace."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"By default, the presence of a part-symbol element that does not extend across the entire part also indicates a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"corresponding change in the common barlines within a part."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLPartSymbol","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLPartSymbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPartSymbol/value":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The value of this element."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartsymbol\/value","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"value"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL19MXLGroupSymbolValueO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLGroupSymbolValue"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"value","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartSymbol\/value","type":"topic"}}}